:"ஆம்பல்","parts":[{"text":"ஆம்பல்","lemma":"ஆம்பல்","gloss":"water lily"}],"gloss":"water lily"},{"surface":"அல்லி","parts":[{"text":"அல்லி","lemma":"அல்லி","gloss":"lily petals/stems"}],"gloss":"lily stems/petals"},{"surface":"உண்ணும்","parts":[{"text":"உண்","lemma":"உண்","gloss":"eat"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"relative participle"}],"gloss":"eating"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கழிகல","parts":[{"text":"கழிகல","lemma":"கழிகல","gloss":"who have discarded ornaments"}],"gloss":"who have discarded ornaments","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மகளிர்","parts":[{"text":"மகளிர்","lemma":"மகளிர்","gloss":"women"}],"gloss":"women"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல்","lemma":"போல்","gloss":"like"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வழி","parts":[{"text":"வழி","lemma":"வழி","gloss":"path/future"}],"gloss":"path/future"},{"surface":"நினைந்து","parts":[{"text":"நினைந்து","lemma":"நினைந்து","gloss":"thinking of"}],"gloss":"thinking of","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"இருத்தல்","parts":[{"text":"இரு","lemma":"இரு","gloss":"remain"},{"text":"த்தல்","lemma":"த்தல்","gloss":"verbal noun suffix"}],"gloss":"remaining/surviving"},{"surface":"அதனினும்","parts":[{"text":"அதனினும்","lemma":"அதனினும்","gloss":"more than that"}],"gloss":"more than that","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அரிதே","parts":[{"text":"அரிது","lemma":"அரிது","gloss":"difficult"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"is difficult indeed"}]}],"literal":"My lord's chest wounds also are severe / At midnight, having come, bees also buzz / In the tall mansion's limits, lamps also do not stand / Sleepless eyes indeed desire sleep / Fear-inducing brown owl's voice also hoots / Throwing paddy and water, listening to omens / Venerable old women's words also are not reassuring / Oh bard with the small drum! Oh singing songstress! / What will you become, oh pitied ones? To you also / Living here, life indeed is difficult. And I, / With clear water dripping on my washed, shaved head, / Instead of the beautiful, contrasting garland they wore before, / Like the women who have discarded ornaments, eating small white water lily stems, / To remain thinking of his path is even more difficult than that.","translation":"My lord's chest wounds are severe. At midnight, beetles come and buzz around him. In this tall mansion, the lamps do not burn steady. My sleepless eyes long for sleep. The terrifying brown owl hoots, spreading fear. The words of the venerable old women, who throw paddy and water to read the omens, bring no comfort. Oh bard with the small drum! Oh singing songstress! What will become of you, poor souls? For you too, living here is now impossible. And for me, to shave my head, wash it so clear water drips, discard the beautiful, contrasting garlands I once wore, eat only the stems of small white water lilies like other ornament-stripped widows, and survive merely thinking of his path—that is even more difficult.","modern":"என் தலைவனுடைய mārbil பட்ட காயங்கள் மிகவும் கொடியவை. நடுநிசியில் வண்டுகள் வந்து அவன் காயங்களைச் சுற்றி ஒலிக்கின்றன. பெரிய மாளிகையில் விளக்குகள் நிலைத்து எரியாமல் அணைகின்றன. உறங்காத என் கண்கள் உறக்கத்தை வேண்டுகின்றன. அச்சம் தரும் கூகையின் குரல் அலறுகிறது. நெல்லையும் நீரையும் தூவி விரிச்சி (நற்சொல்) கேட்கும் முதுபெண்டிரின் சொற்களும் ஆறுதல் தருவதாக இல்லை. துடி என்னும் பறையை உடைய பாணனே! பாடும் விறலியே! இரங்கத்தக்கவர்களே, உங்களுக்கு என்ன நேருமோ? உங்களுக்கும் இங்கு தங்கி வாழும் வாழ்க்கை அரிதானது. நானும், தலைமுடி மழிக்கப்பட்டு, தூய நீர் வழியுமாறு நீராடி, முன்பு அணிந்திருந்த அழகிய மாலைகளை விடுத்து, அணிகலன்களைக் களைந்த கைம்பெண்களைப் போலச் சிறிய வெண்மையான ஆம்பல் அல்லியை உண்டு, அவனது வழியை நினைத்துக் கொண்டு உயிர் வாழ்ந்திருப்பது அதைவிடவும் அரிதானது.","explanation":"In this poem, the wife of a fatally wounded warrior speaks to the visiting bard and songstress. Her husband lies dying from severe chest wounds, and the household is filled with dark omens: beetles buzz around the wounds, lamps flicker out, and the terrifying brown owl hoots. Old women try to find hopeful signs by throwing paddy and water, but their words bring no comfort. The wife tells the bards that their livelihood here is over, as the patron is dying, and advises them that staying is impossible. She then contemplates her own grim future as a widow, stating that to shave her head, eat only water-lily stems, and survive merely remembering him is far more difficult than death itself.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.9],[0.9,1.3],[1.3,1.86],[1.86,2.34],[2.34,2.7],[2.7,3.0],[3.0,3.5],[3.5,5.0],[5.0,5.2],[5.2,5.6],[5.6,6.0],[6.0,7.2],[7.2,7.5],[7.5,8.08],[8.08,8.67],[8.67,9.4],[9.4,9.83],[9.83,10.4],[10.4,10.91],[10.91,11.43],[11.9,12.4],[12.4,12.6],[12.6,12.8],[12.8,13.55],[13.55,14.3],[14.3,14.8],[14.8,15.1],[15.1,15.76],[15.76,16.2],[16.2,16.7],[16.7,17.3],[18.0,18.47],[18.47,19.01],[19.09,19.4],[19.4,19.8],[19.8,20.7],[20.7,21.0],[21.0,21.5],[21.5,21.95],[21.95,22.4],[22.4,23.3],[23.3,24.3],[24.3,24.73],[24.73,25.06],[25.06,25.6],[25.6,26.03],[26.03,26.57],[26.57,27.0],[27.0,27.35],[27.35,27.7],[27.7,28.1],[28.1,28.3],[28.3,29.2],[29.2,30.1],[30.1,30.3],[30.3,31.3],[31.3,31.7],[31.7,32.0],[32.0,32.7]],"female":[[0.0,0.5],[0.5,0.9],[0.9,1.3],[1.3,1.5],[1.5,2.36],[2.36,3.0],[3.0,3.3],[3.3,3.9],[3.9,5.6],[5.6,5.8],[5.8,6.2],[6.2,6.7],[6.7,8.0],[8.0,8.3],[8.3,8.7],[8.7,9.1],[9.1,10.6],[10.73,11.0],[11.0,11.4],[11.4,11.6],[11.6,12.9],[12.9,13.4],[13.4,13.6],[13.6,13.8],[13.8,14.65],[14.65,15.5],[15.5,16.1],[16.1,16.3],[16.3,17.08],[17.08,17.6],[17.6,18.0],[18.0,18.8],[19.52,19.97],[20.52,20.72],[20.72,21.02],[21.02,21.52],[21.52,22.32],[22.32,22.62],[22.62,23.12],[23.12,23.32],[23.32,23.62],[23.62,24.22],[24.22,25.72],[25.72,26.08],[26.08,26.64],[26.64,27.57],[27.57,28.03],[28.03,28.61],[28.61,29.08],[29.08,29.54],[29.54,30.0],[30.0,30.35],[30.35,30.52],[30.52,31.62],[31.62,32.12],[32.12,32.52],[32.52,33.72],[33.72,34.22],[34.22,34.52],[34.52,35.22]]},"sync":[[["என்னை","my lord"]],[["மார்பின்","in the chest"]],[["புண்ணும்","wounds also"]],[["வெய்ய","are severe"]],[["நடுநாள்","midnight"]],[["வந்து","having come"]],[["தும்பியும்","beetles also"]],[["துவைக்கும்","buzz"]],[["நெடுநகர்","tall mansion"]],[["வரைப்பின்","within the house"]],[["விளக்கும்","lamps also"]],[["நில்லா","do not stand"]],[["துஞ்சா","sleepless"]],[["கண்ணே","eyes indeed"]],[["துயிலும்","sleep"]],[["வேட்கும்","desire"]],[["அஞ்சுவரு","fear-inducing"]],[["குராஅல்","brown owl"]],[["குரலும்","voice also"]],[["தூற்றும்","hoots"]],[["நெல்","paddy"],["நீர்","water"]],[["எறிந்து","having thrown"]],[["விரிச்சி","omen"]],[["ஓர்க்கும்","listening to"]],[["செம்","venerable"],["முது","old"]],[["பெண்டின்","women's"]],[["சொல்லும்","words also"]],[["நிரம்பா","are not reassuring"]],[["துடிய","having the small drum"]],[["பாண","oh bard!"]],[["பாடுவல்","singing"]],[["விறலி","oh songstress!"]],[["என்","what"],["ஆகுவிர்","will you become"]],[["ஆகுவிர்","will you become"],["கொல்","particle of doubt"]],[["அளியிர்","oh pitied ones!"]],[["நுமக்கும்","to you also"]],[["இவண்","here"]],[["உறை","living"]],[["வாழ்க்கையோ","life indeed"]],[["அரிதே","is difficult"]],[["யானும்","and I"]],[["மண்","wash"],["உறு","undergo"]],[["மழி","shaved"],["தலை","head"],["தெள்","clear"]],[["நீர்","water"]],[["வார","to flow"]],[["தொன்று","before"],["தாம்","they"]],[["உடுத்த","wore"]],[["அம்","beautiful"],["பகை","contrast/beauty"],["தெரியல்","garland"]],[["தெரியல்","garland"]],[["சிறு","small"],["வெள்","white"]],[["ஆம்பல்","water lily"]],[["அல்லி","lily stems/petals"]],[["உண்ணும்","eating"]],[["கழிகல","who have discarded ornaments"]],[["மகளிர்","women"]],[["போல","like"]],[["வழி","path/future"],["நினைந்து","thinking of"]],[["இருத்தல்","remaining/surviving"]],[["அதனினும்","more than that"]],[["அரிதே","is difficult indeed"]]]}